{"seq":10,"slug":"api-gateway-patterns","title":"API 网关模式","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"api-网关模式\">API 网关模式</h1><p>API 网关是现代微服务架构中位于客户端与后端服务之间的统一入口层，承担路由、认证、限流、协议转换等横切关注点。本 Hub 聚焦于<strong>网关的设计模式与工程实践</strong>——从核心职责划分到安全机制，从弹性策略到可观测性建设，帮助读者建立&quot;如何设计一个生产级 API 网关层&quot;的完整认知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的边界\">本 Hub 的边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>本 Hub 覆盖</th>\n<th>不覆盖（看其他 Hub）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网关路由与负载均衡</td>\n<td>路径匹配、权重路由、灰度发布路由</td>\n<td>服务发现底层（<code>12_distributed-systems</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证与授权</td>\n<td>OAuth 2.0 在网关的集成、JWT 验证、API Key</td>\n<td>详细的 IAM/RBAC 实现（<code>07_cloud-security-compliance</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹性</td>\n<td>限流、熔断、重试、缓存</td>\n<td>分布式限流底层（<code>06_rate-limiting-circuit-breaking</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可观测性</td>\n<td>网关层的日志、Trace、指标采集</td>\n<td>Prometheus/Jaeger 部署运维（<code>05_observability-engineering</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFF 模式</td>\n<td>多客户端聚合、响应裁剪</td>\n<td>BFF 详细实现（<code>01_bff-patterns-aggregation</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>第 1 章 网关基础</strong>：先理解网关在系统中的位置、路由机制和协议转换能力，建立架构全貌。</li>\n<li><strong>第 2 章 安全与认证</strong>：了解网关层如何集中化处理身份验证、权限检查和 TLS 终止。</li>\n<li><strong>第 3 章 弹性与流量管理</strong>：掌握限流、熔断、重试和缓存策略，保护后端服务不被打垮。</li>\n<li><strong>第 4 章 可观测性与运维</strong>：学习如何让网关本身成为可观测的基础设施，并管理 API 版本生命周期。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>HTTP/HTTPS 基础（请求/响应模型、状态码、Header）</li>\n<li>微服务架构基础概念（服务间通信、服务注册）</li>\n<li>了解 Docker/Kubernetes 基础部署概念（有助于理解实际部署方式）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><code>01_bff-patterns-aggregation</code>：BFF（Backend for Frontend）是特殊的网关聚合模式</li>\n<li><code>06_rate-limiting-circuit-breaking</code>：深度讲解限流与熔断的算法实现</li>\n<li><code>09_resilience-engineering-failure-recovery</code>：更宏观的弹性工程视角</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"网关基础与核心职责","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-architecture-overview","title":"网关架构总览：API 网关在微服务中的位置与职责","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals/gateway-architecture-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-load-balancing","title":"路由与负载均衡：网关如何将请求精准分发到后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals/routing-load-balancing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"protocol-transformation","title":"协议转换与请求变换：网关如何做格式桥接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/fundamentals/protocol-transformation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"security","title":"安全与认证授权","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"authentication-at-gateway","title":"网关层认证机制：集中化身份验证的实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authentication-at-gateway"},{"seq":2,"slug":"authorization-access-control","title":"授权与访问控制：网关如何决定\"能做什么\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authorization-access-control"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tls-certificate-management","title":"TLS 终止与证书管理：网关的 HTTPS 安全基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/tls-certificate-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"resilience","title":"弹性与流量管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rate-limiting-throttling","title":"限流与节流策略：网关如何控制请求速率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/rate-limiting-throttling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"circuit-breaking-retry","title":"熔断与重试：网关的故障隔离机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/circuit-breaking-retry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"caching-gateway","title":"网关层缓存：减少后端压力的响应缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/resilience/caching-gateway"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"observability","title":"可观测性与运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-logging-metrics","title":"网关日志与指标：构建 API 层的可见性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/gateway-logging-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-tracing-gateway","title":"分布式链路追踪：网关如何成为追踪的起点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/distributed-tracing-gateway"},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-versioning-lifecycle","title":"API 版本管理与生命周期：如何优雅地演进 API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/observability/api-versioning-lifecycle"}]}]}